ready be in possession, the caller should not          call this function directly and should instead call a helper function that transfers          the funds to the RNG service before calling this function.If there is a pending RNG service (see _nextRng), it will be swapped in before the          auction is completed.","params":{"_rewardRecipient":"Address that will be allocated the auction reward for starting the RNG request. The recipient can withdraw the rewards from the Prize Pools that use the random number once all subsequent auctions are complete."}},"transferOwnership(address)":{"params":{"_newOwner":"Address to transfer ownership to."}}},"stateVariables":{"auctionDuration":{"details":"This must always be less than the sequence period since the auction needs to complete each period."},"sequenceOffset":{"details":"If the next sequence starts at unix timestamp `t`, then a valid offset is equal to `t % sequencePeriod`.If the offset is set to some point in the future, some calculations will fail until that time, effectively preventing any auctions until then."},"sequencePeriod":{"details":"This must always be greater than the auction duration."}},"title":"PoolTogether V5 RngAuction","version":1},"userdoc":{"errors":{"AuctionDurationGTSequencePeriod(uint64,uint64)":[{"notice":"Thrown when the auction duration is greater than or equal to the sequence."}],"AuctionExpired()":[{"notice":"Thrown if the time elapsed since the start of the auction is greater than the auction duration."}],"AuctionTargetTimeExceedsDuration(uint64,uint64)":[{"notice":"Thrown if the auction target time exceeds the auction duration."}],"CannotStartNextSequence()":[{"notice":"Thrown if the next sequence cannot yet be started"}],"OwnerZeroAddress()":[{"notice":"Thrown if owner set is the zero address."}],"PRBMath_MulDiv18_Overflow(uint256,uint256)":[{"notice":"Thrown when the resultant value in {mulDiv18} overflows uint256."}],"PRBMath_MulDiv_Overflow(uint256,uint256,uint256)":[{"notice":"Thrown when the resultant value in {mulDiv} overflows uint256."}],"PRBMath_UD60x18_Convert_Overflow(uint256)":[{"notice":"Thrown when converting a basic integer to the fixed-point format overflows UD60x18."}],"PRBMath_UD60x18_IntoUD2x18_Overflow(uint256)":[{"notice":"Thrown when trying to cast a UD60x18 number that doesn't fit in UD2x18."}],"RewardRecipientIsZero()":[{"notice":"Emitted when the zero address is passed as reward recipient"}],"RngZeroAddress()":[{"notice":"Thrown when the RNG address passed to the setter function is zero address."}],"SequencePeriodZero()":[{"notice":"Thrown when the sequence period is zero."}],"TargetRewardFractionGTOne()":[{"notice":"Thrown when the first auction target reward fraction is greater than one."}]},"events":{"RngAuctionCompleted(address,address,uint32,address,uint32,uint64,uint64)":{"notice":"Emitted when the auction is completed."},"SetNextRngService(address)":{"notice":"Emitted when the RNG service address is set."}},"kind":"user","methods":{"auctionDuration()":{"notice":"Duration of the auction in seconds"},"auctionElapsedTime()":{"notice":"The amount of time remaining in the current open auction"},"auctionTargetTime()":{"notice":"The target time to complete the auction in seconds"},"canStartNextSequence()":{"notice":"Determines if the next sequence can be started."},"claimOwnership()":{"notice":"Allows the `_pendingOwner` address to finalize the transfer."},"computeRewardFraction(uint64)":{"notice":"Computes the reward fraction for the given auction elapsed time."},"constructor":{"notice":"Deploy the RngAuction smart contract."},"currentFractionalReward()":{"notice":"Calculates the reward fraction for the current auction if it were to be completed at this time."},"getLastAuction()":{"notice":"The last auction results."},"getLastAuctionResult()":{"notice":"Returns the last auction as an AuctionResult struct to be used to calculate rewards."},"getLastRngService()":{"notice":"Returns the RNG service used to generate random numbers."},"getNextRngService()":{"notice":"Returns the pending RNG service that will replace the current service before the next auction completes."},"getRngResults()":{"notice":"Returns the result of the last RNG Request."},"isAuctionOpen()":{"notice":"Checks if the auction is still open and if it can be completed."},"isRngComplete()":{"notice":"Returns whether the RNG request has completed or not for the current sequence."},"lastSequenceId()":{"notice":"Returns the sequence ID from the last auction."},"openSequenceId()":{"notice":"Calculates a unique identifier for the current sequence."},"owner()":{"notice":"Returns the address of the current owner."},"pendingOwner()":{"notice":"Gets current `_pendingOwner`."},"renounceOwnership()":{"notice":"Renounce ownership of the contract."},"sequenceOffset()":{"notice":"Offset of the sequence in seconds"},"sequencePeriod()":{"notice":"Duration of the sequence that the auction should align with"},"setNextRngService(address)":{"notice":"Sets the RNG service used to generate random numbers."},"startRngRequest(address)":{"notice":"Starts the RNG Request, ends the current auction, and stores the reward fraction to          be allocated to the recipient."},"transferOwnership(address)":{"notice":"Allows current owner to set the `_pendingOwner` address."}},"notice":"The RngAuction allows anyone to request a new random number using the RNG service set.         The auction incentivises RNG requests to be started in-sync with prize pool draw         periods across all chains.","version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"lib/pt-v5-draw-auction/src/RngAuction.sol":"RngAuction"},"evmVersion":"paris","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":200},"remappings":[":@aave/core-v3/=lib/aave-address-book/lib/aave-v3-core/",":@aave/periphery-v3/=lib/aave-address-book/lib/aave-v3-periphery/",":@openzeppelin/=lib/pt-v5-draw-auction/lib/openzeppelin-contracts/",":@prb/test/=lib/pt-v5-vault-boost/lib/pr